---
description: Frontend rules for internal web UI (Create + Manage pages)
globs: ["frontend/**"]
alwaysApply: false
---

## Pages
1) Create Short Link
- Form fields: Original URL, Tag dropdown, Expiry (Permanent or Date/Time), Note.
- Inline validation and clear error messages.
- On success: show result card with Short URL + copy button.

2) Manage Links
- Table list with filters: query, tag, status; default sort by created_at desc.
- Row action: Disable link with confirmation modal.
- Ensure short URL display preserves CODE casing.

## API integration
- Centralize API calls in a small api client module.
- All API types should be strongly typed (TypeScript interfaces).
- Treat expires_at null as “Permanent”.

## UX constraints
- Keep UI minimal and fast; do not add auth flows.
- Prefer server-side pagination when list may grow.
